msgstr "打开 Hex Radio 网络电台播放器:来自世界各地的数千个电台,可按流派或名称查找。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_radio.html.heex:11
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Opens the Hex Radio window, or brings it to the front when it is already open — the same window Start > Accessories > Hex Radio opens."
msgstr "打开 Hex Radio 窗口;如果窗口已经打开,则将其置于最前——与 Start > Accessories > Hex Radio 打开的是同一个窗口。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_radio.html.heex:24
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Star the stations you like to find them again"
msgstr "为喜欢的电台加星标,方便再次找到"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_radio.html.heex:26
